sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Listener as Praxis Listener<br/>8080/TCP
    participant FilterPipeline as Filter Pipeline<br/>(HttpFilter chain)
    participant Router as Router Filter
    participant Upstream as Upstream Cluster<br/>Configurable Port
    participant Admin as Admin API<br/>9902/TCP
    participant ContainerRT as Container Runtime
    participant OTLP as OTLP Collector<br/>(optional)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 1: HTTP Proxy Request
        Client->>Listener: HTTP/HTTPS Request<br/>TLS 1.2+ (configurable)
        Listener->>FilterPipeline: Execute request_filter chain
        Note over FilterPipeline: Filters execute in order:<br/>1. request_id<br/>2. trace_context<br/>3. forwarded_headers<br/>4. basic_auth / ip_acl<br/>5. cors / csrf<br/>6. rate_limit / token_bucket<br/>7. header / path_rewrite
        FilterPipeline->>Router: Route selection
        Router->>Upstream: Forward request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS/TCP (configurable TLS)
        Upstream-->>Router: Response
        Router-->>FilterPipeline: Execute response_filter chain
        Note over FilterPipeline: Response filters:<br/>1. compression<br/>2. grpc_status<br/>3. access_log
        FilterPipeline-->>Listener: Filtered response
        Listener-->>Client: HTTP/HTTPS Response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over ContainerRT,Admin: Flow 2: Health Check / Metrics
        ContainerRT->>Admin: GET /healthy<br/>HTTP (no TLS, no auth)
        Admin-->>ContainerRT: 200 OK
        ContainerRT->>Admin: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP (no TLS, no auth)
        Admin-->>ContainerRT: Prometheus metrics
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Listener,OTLP: Flow 3: OpenTelemetry Export (optional)
        Listener->>OTLP: Export spans<br/>gRPC (tonic) or HTTP<br/>TLS (trusts native roots)
        Note over OTLP: Distributed tracing<br/>and metrics
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
        Note over Listener,FilterPipeline: Flow 4: Configuration Hot-Reload
        Note over Listener: File watcher detects<br/>config change (notify)
        Note over Listener: 500ms debounce
        Note over Listener: Build new FilterPipeline
        Note over Listener: ArcSwap atomic swap
        Note over Listener: In-flight requests drain<br/>on old pipeline
    end
